    {"type": "text", "id": "l_authorized", "x": 430, "y": 278, "width": 320, "height": 16, "text": "authorizedBy · the Account that linked it", "originalText": "authorizedBy · the Account that linked it", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 100059, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 100060, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
    {"type": "text", "id": "s1_note", "x": 100, "y": 722, "width": 860, "height": 32, "text": "structural: personalProfileOf(A,P) + memberOf(A,H) ⇒ sharedInto(P,H) — your Profile is always available at home\nevery edge is a row (or a column) in PostgreSQL; Cedar reads them, never stores them", "originalText": "structural: personalProfileOf(A,P) + memberOf(A,H) ⇒ sharedInto(P,H) — your Profile is always available at home\nevery edge is a row (or a column) in PostgreSQL; Cedar reads them, never stores them", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 100061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 100062, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
    {"type": "text", "id": "s2_title", "x": 1020, "y": 160, "width": 600, "height": 25, "text": "2 · Authority is a path through the graph", "originalText": "2 · Authority is a path through the graph", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200002, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s2_code", "x": 1020, "y": 200, "width": 720, "height": 190, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200004, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "s2_code_text", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "s2_code_text", "x": 1036, "y": 222, "width": 688, "height": 140, "text": "memberOf(A,H)                                 -> mayUse(A,H)\npersonalProfileOf(A,P) + sharedInto(P,H)      -> mayUse(A,H)\nmayUse(A,H) + sharedInto(P,H)                 -> maySelect(A,P) in H\npersonalProfileOf(A,P) + unrestrictedAdult(P) -> selfManages(A,P)\nselfManages(A,P) -> endShare(P, any H but home) · removeManager(P)\nadminOf(A,H) + sharedInto(P,H)                -> administers(A,P) while active\n  + restricted(P)                             -> supervises(A,P) while active\nregisteredTo(D,H) + sharedInto(P,H)           -> selectableOn(P,D)", "originalText": "memberOf(A,H)                                 -> mayUse(A,H)\npersonalProfileOf(A,P) + sharedInto(P,H)      -> mayUse(A,H)\nmayUse(A,H) + sharedInto(P,H)                 -> maySelect(A,P) in H\npersonalProfileOf(A,P) + unrestrictedAdult(P) -> selfManages(A,P)\nselfManages(A,P) -> endShare(P, any H but home) · removeManager(P)\nadminOf(A,H) + sharedInto(P,H)                -> administers(A,P) while active\n  + restricted(P)                             -> supervises(A,P) while active\nregisteredTo(D,H) + sharedInto(P,H)           -> selectableOn(P,D)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200006, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "s2_code", "lineHeight": 1.25},
    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s2_forbid", "x": 1020, "y": 412, "width": 720, "height": 84, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200008, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "s2_forbid_text", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "s2_forbid_text", "x": 1036, "y": 426, "width": 688, "height": 54, "text": "forbid — share-derived authority never creates a portable edge, changes a kind,\nor leaves a Profile unrestricted: no managerOf · no personalProfileOf · no sharedInto\nelsewhere · no transfer · no delete · no kind change · no lifting the last ceiling", "originalText": "forbid — share-derived authority never creates a portable edge, changes a kind,\nor leaves a Profile unrestricted: no managerOf · no personalProfileOf · no sharedInto\nelsewhere · no transfer · no delete · no kind change · no lifting the last ceiling", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200009, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200010, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "s2_forbid", "lineHeight": 1.25},
    {"type": "text", "id": "s2_note_use", "x": 1020, "y": 512, "width": 720, "height": 32, "text": "mayUse means the same for a member and a visitor · restricted means supervised\nselfManages is sovereignty over one's own identity · the rest is in the ADR", "originalText": "mayUse means the same for a member and a visitor · restricted means supervised\nselfManages is sovereignty over one's own identity · the rest is in the ADR", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200012, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25},
